# name: test_mermaid_block_in_output
  '''
  ## airflow-diff: 1 DAG changed
  
  Base: `abc1234` → Head: `def5678`
  ### `my_dag` — 1 task added, 1 task modified
  ```mermaid
  graph LR
    classDef added fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:2px,color:#1a7f37
    classDef removed fill:#ffebe9,stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:2px,color:#cf222e
    classDef modified fill:#fff8c5,stroke:#9a6700,stroke-width:2px,color:#9a6700
    classDef unchanged fill:#f6f8fa,stroke:#656d76,color:#1f2328
    n_extract_data["extract_data ✎"]:::modified
    n_transform["transform"]:::unchanged
    n_validate_data["+ validate_data"]:::added
    n_extract_data -.-> n_transform
    n_extract_data ==> n_validate_data
    linkStyle 0 stroke:#cf222e,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:5
    linkStyle 1 stroke:#1a7f37,stroke-width:2.5px
  ```
  | Task | Field | Change |
  |------|-------|--------|
  | `extract_data` | `bash_command` | modified |
  | `extract_data` → `transform` | _(downstream edge)_ | removed |
  | `extract_data` → `validate_data` | _(downstream edge)_ | added |
  | `validate_data` | _(whole task)_ | added |
  <details><summary>my_dag.extract_data.bash_command</summary>
  
  ```diff
  - aws s3 cp s3://<VAR:bucket>/2025-01-01 /tmp/in
  + aws s3 cp s3://<VAR:bucket_v2>/2025-01-01 /tmp/in
  ```
  
  </details>
  
  '''
# ---
